# The NEAR candidate injection, before and after
#
# commit (parent): 4e29d8fa  (main@origin at the time of the run)
# host:            Apple M-series, aarch64-apple-darwin (this repo's primary)
# C oracle:        reference/svt-av1 @ fix/suspected-c-bug-17, run through
#                  tools/ctrace-linux/run.sh (linux/arm64 container -- Apple
#                  ld64 has no -Wl,--wrap, so the interposers only exist there)
# sweep:           tools/inter_byte_matrix.sh, defaults
#                  {uniform,gradient,diag,screen} x {16,64,72,128} square
#                  x {q20,q40,q55} x {p6,p8}, frames=2, shift=3, low-delay P
#
# before: 91 BOTH / 4 F1DIFF / 1 F0DIFF / 0 CRASH   (inter_byte_matrix_2026-09-03-before-near.tsv)
# after:  92 BOTH / 3 F1DIFF / 1 F0DIFF / 0 CRASH   (this file)
#
# Promoted: diag 72x72 q40 p6  (frame 1: 29 B -> C's 28 B)
# Regressed: none.
#
# The three residual F1DIFF cells did NOT move by a byte:
#   diag  72x72  q55 p6   port 31  C 29   (identical before and after)
#   diag  72x72  q55 p8   port 30  C 29   (identical before and after)
#   diag 128x128 q20 p8   port 26  C 25   (identical before and after)
# The one F0DIFF (gradient 128x128 q20 p8, a video-KEY defect) is unchanged.
#
# The join that drove it, C's SVT_IFCOST_OUT (SVT_IFCOST_XY=64,32) against the
# port's SVTAV1_CANDDBG `NSQDBG ICAND`, at mi=(8,16) on `diag 72x72 q40 p6`
# frame 1 -- fast_luma_rate per MDS0 candidate:
#
#   mode         rf     mv       C flr   port flr (before)
#   13 NEARESTMV  1     (0,-24)   2520    2520
#   14 NEARMV     1     (24,0)    2845    ABSENT
#   13 NEARESTMV  5     (24,0)    4957    4957
#   17 NEAREST_N. 1,5   (24,0)    3667    suppressed (bipred, by design)
#   16 NEWMV      1     (24,0)    n/a     4187   <- what the port coded
#
# C's MDS0 cost is (lambda * flr) >> 9 + distortion * 128 with lambda=188575:
# NEARMV 3 525 924 beats the port's NEWMV 4 020 196. The port's rate model was
# already exact on both shared candidates; the candidate itself was missing,
# because `inter_md_arm` handed the injector a DEFAULTED `near_count_ctrls`
# while C's is {enabled 1, near_count 3, near_near_count 3} at every level the
# video arm assigns (enc_mode_config.c:4113/4138/4163, :9039-9050).
#
# Full record: benchmarks/inter_near_candidate_2026-09-03.md
